{"overview":"نمایی میخ‌کوب‌کننده به زندگی قهرمانان معمولی متعهد به یکی از شریف‌ترین حرفه‌های آمریکا. برای آتش‌نشانان، جوخه نجات و امدادگران آتش‌نشانی شیکاگو ۵۱، هیچ پیشه‌ای دلهره‌آورتر یا خطرناک‌تر و در عین حال همین‌قدر ارزشمند و مهیج وجود ندارد. این مردان و زنان شجاع از جمله نخبگانی هستند که با سر به دل خطر می‌زنند، زمانی که دیگران به مسیر دیگر می‌گریزند و اعمال‌شان تفاوت مرگ و زندگی را رقم می‌زنند.","tagline":"حرارت را احساس کن.","overview_en":"An edge-of-your-seat view into the lives of everyday heroes committed to one of America's noblest professions. For the firefighters, rescue squad and paramedics of Chicago Firehouse 51, no occupation is more stressful or dangerous, yet so rewarding and exhilarating. These courageous men and women are among the elite who forge headfirst into danger when everyone else is running the other way and whose actions make the difference between life and death.","tagline_en":"Welcome home.","runtime":42,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":1,"y":2014,"poster":"/bXsGNwm5702NN7q5satF71aHBDM.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":2012,"poster":"/fTVZTV41lI9EFPTEjwRBmierHUE.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":22,"y":2013,"poster":"/wqsi6oKOc8hGA8153pJEM5Pc9jQ.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":23,"y":2014,"poster":"/28WoFa8Fqc2g8kAWGTCoe7xhfEI.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":23,"y":2015,"poster":"/xiK4j8nYKn1J6XF9BQTPMnnw9u3.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":22,"y":2016,"poster":"/mBnkMUXCNpHbMS3cVAxxduzK8QU.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":23,"y":2017,"poster":"/cGnO7EgUtA0iCChGRp7nmV4gCwv.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":22,"y":2018,"poster":"/pvM5Jjq8naDLLWe1Q3y7E5kGq7X.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":20,"y":2019,"poster":"/ayxFXKJ5P2C3giEr9Kr6SbrdnwR.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":16,"y":2020,"poster":"/6AccYL0eb7uzHn98IKaNjvJbyuA.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":22,"y":2021,"poster":"/yrV8eSwhCkMAJVZUK65PXTfYOqq.jpg"},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":22,"y":2022,"poster":"/iiI1YU8akLYWdWuX1qHuMYPvSHC.jpg"